      <title>Hantavirus Outbreak on Cruise Ship</title>
      <link>https://www.google.com</link>
      <description>&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Summary:&lt;/b&gt; A hantavirus outbreak on a cruise ship has led to key takeaways from a WHO briefing, highlighting transmission risks and containment measures. Luis Rodriguez retires from the CDC Vessel Sanitation Program amid the outbreak, while scientists emphasize that the event does not signal a new pandemic. The incident underscores the importance of sanitation protocols on cruise ships.&lt;/li&gt;
